			"notes": "# 1.21.1_1.1.0\n\nHappy New Year !\nAdded new content, i would really appreciate if you could give a feedback \\:)\n\n## Changelog\n\n### Added\n- Custom Dimension\n- Portal to access dimension\n- Reindeer entity & Spawn Egg\n- Mannala/Mannele (new food item)\n- Stellar Candy Tools\n- Stellar Tools\n\n### Fixed\n-  Trapdoor not being craftable\n- Frozen bush not spawning correctly on biomes\n\n### Updated\n- Shiro & Red Omorika wood texture\n- RedOmorika tree\n- Custom Biome generation\n\n\n### Next Steps\nI will try to expand and enrich A Christmas Tale, but as I'm really busy with my IT Studies I don't have a lot of time to work on ACT.\nBut I will try my best !"
		},
